text":"Ah, you're back!","nextNodeIds":[745300402,745300403]},{"nodeId":745300402,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2752319050,"text":"You seem to be in a good mood, Kachina.","nextNodeIds":[745300404]},{"nodeId":745300404,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30918,"speakerName":"Kachina","textMapHash":1856578706,"text":"Hehe. I found some awesome ore during this excavation!","nextNodeIds":[745300405]},{"nodeId":745300405,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30918,"speakerName":"Kachina","textMapHash":1104512026,"text":"If polished properly, it could turn into a big, shiny gemstone!","nextNodeIds":[745300406]},{"nodeId":745300406,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2866533490,"text":"That's great!","nextNodeIds":[745300407]},{"nodeId":745300407,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30918,"speakerName":"Kachina","textMapHash":4022957466,"text":"Right? To be honest, the dig didn't get off to a good start, and I almost went home empty-handed.","nextNodeIds":[745300408]},{"nodeId":745300408,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30918,"speakerName":"Kachina","textMapHash":1024757098,"text":"But I thought to myself that I should hang on a little longer. So I did, and then I held out a little longer, and a little longer...","nextNodeIds":[745300409]},{"nodeId":745300409,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30918,"speakerName":"Kachina","textMapHash":130192042,"text":"I don't know how many times I repeated that... but I got it in the end!","nextNodeIds":[745300410]},{"nodeId":745300410,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30918,"speakerName":"Kachina","textMapHash":4070623570,"text":"I only realized that the sun was setting when I got outside... I wound up digging all day.","nextNodeIds":[745300411,745300412]},{"nodeId":745300411,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1854148458,"text":"That's our Kachina, alright.","nextNodeIds":[745300413]},{"nodeId":745300413,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30918,"speakerName":"Kachina","textMapHash":3111796194,"text":"R—Really? I—I... kinda get shy in front of Kameras... I'm not sure this'll go well...","nextNodeIds":[745300414]},{"nodeId":745300414,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30918,"speakerName":"Kachina","textMapHash":2864256906,"text":"But... I'll do my best!","nextNodeIds":[745300415,745300416]},{"nodeId":745300415,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":4219987922,"text":"You're already doing your best, Kachina.","nextNodeIds":[745300417]},{"nodeId":745300417,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30918,"speakerName":"Kachina","textMapHash":1879870946,"text":"Okay then! I'll leave it to you.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":745300416,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2316883642,"text":"You're great just the way you are.","nextNodeIds":[745300417]},{"nodeId":745300412,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":351545770,"text":"Let me take a picture of you shining bright!","nextNodeIds":[745300413]},{"nodeId":745300403,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2658614978,"text":"Has something good happened?","nextNodeIds":[745300404]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA_NOTIFY","PPFLKMOMKAI":"7453001"}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"}}},{"subQues